# Open Licensing & Mandatory Attribution Notice — NOUinnsikt Open Raw-Data Archive

This repository and its accompanying GitHub Release archives contain three distinct layers of open public knowledge and software. Any reuse, redistribution, derivative work, or publication using the curated datasets, enrichments, or audio summaries **legally requires attribution (credit) to Tor Sivertsen Prestegard** under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**.

