## 4. Data Compilation, AI/OCR Editing & Fair Warning Disclaimer

1. **Automated OCR & Text Conversion (1972–2026):** The 1,746 reports span scanned historical books (`nb.no` / UiO, 1972–1993), early digital PDFs (1994–2013), and modern HTML/EPUB/PDF documents (`regjeringen.no`, 2014–2026). Full-text chunks (`614,643` rows across `1,682` full-text reports, `96.3%` coverage) were extracted and deduplicated programmatically; older scanned documents may contain OCR errors, broken tables, or partial text coverage (~64 reports).
2. **AI-Generated Enrichments & Audio:** Executive summaries (`summary*`), structured infographics (`infographic`), taxonomy mappings, policy evolution syntheses, and the 764 dual-host MP3 audio summaries were synthesized or structured using Large Language Models (Google Gemini / local LLMs) and neural Text-to-Speech. AI outputs may compress nuances or contain inaccuracies and must never be cited as official commission text.
3. **Heuristic Metadata & Lifecycle Extraction:** Committee rosters (`nou_authors`, 20,205 records), organization classifications, name-based gender inference, minority dissents, citation graphs, and Stortinget/Lovdata lifecycle mappings were compiled via automated parsing and API matching and may contain omissions or matching artifacts.
4. **No Warranty & Mandatory Primary Verification:** THE SOFTWARE AND DATASETS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. USERS MUST ALWAYS VERIFY QUOTES, COMMITTEE ROSTERS, DISSENTS, AND STATUTORY CITATIONS AGAINST PRIMARY OFFICIAL SOURCES AT REGJERINGEN.NO, NB.NO, STORTINGET.NO, AND LOVDATA.NO.
